EESchema Schematic File Version 4
EELAYER 30 0
EELAYER END
$Descr User 49600 28050
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "DC-Modules 60 kW — AC-DC board (Vienna PFC, 2x cells)"
Date "2026-09-06"
Rev "D.3"
Comp "DC-Modules 60 kW - board AC-DC (lower), sheet 1 of 2"
Comment1 "Module 60 kW = two-board sandwich: sheet 1 AC-DC (lower) + sheet 2 DC-DC (upper), bolted DCP/DCN/PE studs + 16-way control harness"
Comment2 "Content: 2x Vienna PFC cells + 2x 3-ph LLC cells"
Comment3 "36 functional sections - 399 components - cross-section links are global net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, CUSTOM = made to drawing)"
$EndDescr
